        "text": "Oral argument before the Supreme Court began at 11:02\u202fa.m."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Rehnquist",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2e96706a298b193dc8af9123e17beb4bae8df94c42a2cc71ce52dfb83bbd4bb5",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2e96706a298b-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Chief Justice Rehnquist asked: \u201cIs this a question of Federal law?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2e96706a298b193dc8af9123e17beb4bae8df94c42a2cc71ce52dfb83bbd4bb5",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2e96706a298b-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Chief Justice later asked: \u201cYou\u2019re now relying on English law, I take it?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2e96706a298b193dc8af9123e17beb4bae8df94c42a2cc71ce52dfb83bbd4bb5",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2e96706a298b-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "A Justice asked: \u201cDoes it make them subject\u2014subjects?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2e96706a298b193dc8af9123e17beb4bae8df94c42a2cc71ce52dfb83bbd4bb5",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2e96706a298b-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "A Justice asked: \u201cHow does that affect a corporation?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2e96706a298b193dc8af9123e17beb4bae8df94c42a2cc71ce52dfb83bbd4bb5",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2e96706a298b-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "A Justice asked about Canadians: \u201cUntil Canada domesticated its constitution\u2026 were they not subjects of the Crown?\u201d"
      }
